Since someone asked for a little explaniation of KOS, here it is;
KOSing is pretty much the short form for "Killing On Sight". It's something very annoying. On sandbox servers(mostly bc kosing is banned on alot of progression servers) alot of people kill just for fun, disturbing the peace of the game. They don't hunt, they just kill. Alot of servers have stable problems because of the bodies that lie around, since it's too much to be eaten, it's a pain, really.

